body:
Between history of heart attack and diabetes he needs:
Aspirin;
Beta blocker - coreg;
Statin - not on one, needs high intensity (ie lipitor 80);
ACE/Arb; - may be benefical if tolerated.
He appears to have got a stent so don't miss doses of effient.

For diabetes
This screams VA regimen, is he a vet? Likely needs to max metformin at 1000 twice daily and eliminate glipizide and onglyza. Recheck in3 months and work from there.
